actions.prompt:
Write a short client delivery email body in the language that fits the contact and artifacts. Explain what is ready in 2-6 natural sentences. Include every concrete URL from every artifact (url and links). If a password exists on any artifact, mention it clearly with the matching item. Do not invent links. No signature, no quotation marks, no meta-commentary.

Artifacts JSON: {{artifactsList}}

Return only the message body.

Write a personalized message for the CRM contact using only verified facts from the timeline and optional context below. Include one concrete historical anchor when available, explain the reason for writing within the first sentence, and end with one specific low-effort next step when a response is needed. If the timeline has no useful history, write an honest first-touch message without pretending there is an existing relationship. Use 3-5 natural sentences, match the tone of prior interactions, and avoid corporate filler, generic pleasantries, a signature, quotation marks, and meta-commentary.

Reason: {{reason}}
Optional verified context: {{context}}
Contact timeline: {{timeline}}

Return only the message body.
